<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@/~part_IV__cl_20__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "1" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@/~part_IV__cl_20__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@/~part_IV__cl_20__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Majlis hendaklah, dari semasa ke semasa, mengenal pasti bidang amalan yang perlu dilaksanakan di Malaysia, dan hendaklah membuat syor kepada Menteri supaya bidang amalan itu ditetapkan sebagai bidang amalan diiktiraf."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@/~part_IV__cl_20__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@/~part_IV__cl_20> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@/~part_IV__cl_20__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@/~part_IV__cl_20__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@/~part_IV__cl_20__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Menteri boleh, selepas mempertimbangkan syor Majlis, melalui perintah yang disiarkan dalam Warta, menetapkan bidang amalan itu sebagai bidang amalan diiktiraf. Pengamal boleh mengamal bidang amalan diiktiraf sahaja"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@/~part_IV__cl_21> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@> .
