<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "8" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@> .
