<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@/~part_IV__cl_27__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@/~part_IV__cl_27__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Sebelum membatalkan pendaftaran seseorang pengamal berdaftar, Majlis hendaklah—"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@/~part_IV__cl_27__subsec_2__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@/~part_IV__cl_27__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@/~part_IV__cl_27__subsec_2__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "a" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/30/msa@> .
